# 🎮 Tic Tac Toe Game

A simple and interactive **Tic Tac Toe** game built with **Python and Streamlit**. Play against a friend on a 3x3 grid and enjoy this classic two-player game directly in your browser!

## 🔗 Live Demo

[🎮 Click here to play the game](YOUR_STREAMLIT_APP_LINK)

---

## 📌 Features

- ✔️ Classic 3x3 Tic Tac Toe board
- 👥 Two-player mode
- ❌ X and ⭕ O player turns
- 🚫 Prevents players from selecting an occupied position
- 🧠 Win detection logic
- 🤝 Draw detection logic
- 🔄 Game reset button
- 🌐 Interactive web-based interface

---

## 💻 Technologies Used

- **Python** – Game logic
- **Streamlit** – Web interface and application framework
- **GitHub** – Source code repository
- **Streamlit Community Cloud** – Application deployment

---

## 🧠 Game Logic

The game uses a **3x3 two-dimensional list** to represent the Tic Tac Toe board.

The game:

1. Creates the board with positions 1–9.
2. Allows Player X and Player O to select positions.
3. Prevents players from selecting an already occupied position.
4. Checks rows, columns, and diagonals for a winner.
5. Detects a draw when all positions are occupied.
6. Allows the players to reset and start a new game.

